  "title": "Greetings from Zakopane",
  "text": "Dear Grandma,\n\nGreetings from Zakopane! We are here with Mum and Dad for one week. Our hotel is small but very nice, and it is near the mountains. The weather is cold and sunny. Every morning we have a big breakfast, and then we go walking in the mountains. I can see snow on the tops! In the evening we eat in a restaurant in the town. I love the soup and the cheese here. Tomorrow we want to go on a horse ride. We come back home on Saturday.\n\nSee you soon!\nLove,\nZosia",
